== hobby.done.read
- You finish a chapter. That was nice.
- You read till the end of the chapter. Just one more? No. Maybe.
== hobby.done.write
- You write a page. Your head feels tidier.
- A few lines in your journal. Today's down on paper now.
== hobby.done.games
- Game over. You nearly had it. Next time.
- You win one, lose one. Fair enough.
== hobby.done.draw
- A sketch you're quietly pleased with.
- Not bad. Not bad at all.
== hobby.done.knit
- A few more rows. It's starting to look like something.
- Knit, purl, done. It's getting longer.
== hobby.done.puzzle
- Solved. You feel very clever.
- One puzzle done. The next one looks harder.
== hobby.done.stars
- The stars drift past. You feel calm.
- You spot a bright one you haven't seen before.

// drawing at a nice view: what you drew ({room} is where you are)
== hobby.drew
- You sketch the view from the {room}. The stars came out well.
- A quick drawing of the {room}. You got the light just right.
- You draw the {room} as it is tonight. Something to keep.

// the Record, in words (no levels or points)
== hobby.record.read
- You read most evenings.
== hobby.record.write
- You keep a journal.
== hobby.record.games
- You like a game on your device.
== hobby.record.draw
- You sketch the ship.
== hobby.record.knit
- You knit. Zeke is very proud.
== hobby.record.puzzle
- You never leave a puzzle unfinished.
== hobby.record.stars
